WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.038 --> 00:00:07.235
Cheese dripped from Lucy.

2
00:00:07.236 --> 00:00:12.946
"Ugh!" She stomped off.

3
00:00:12.947 --> 00:00:17.563
"Uh-oh." Ringo bit his lip.

4
00:00:17.564 --> 00:00:22.709
Lucy was really mad.

5
00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:26.179
Ringo looked around the deck.

6
00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:30.139
"Where did the robot go?" he said.

7
00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:35.869
"Where are the robots?" a passenger yelled.

8
00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:39.043
Another passenger looked mad too.

9
00:00:39.044 --> 00:00:43.166
"Where's my space soda?" she said.

10
00:00:43.167 --> 00:00:48.654
The air sparkled with cloud glitter.

11
00:00:48.655 --> 00:00:54.999
Ringo looked for the robots.

12
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.366
One was lying on the deck.

13
00:00:58.367 --> 00:01:03.028
Smoke came from his head.

14
00:01:03.029 --> 00:01:06.278
Ringo gasped.

15
00:01:06.279 --> 00:01:12.872
"That's the robot who spilled nachos on Lucy."

16
00:01:12.873 --> 00:01:16.286
Just then Lucy came back.

17
00:01:16.287 --> 00:01:21.333
She wore clean clothes.

18
00:01:21.334 --> 00:01:25.038
"Did you break this robot?" Ringo asked.

19
00:01:25.039 --> 00:01:29.223
Lucy frowned. "No!"

20
00:01:29.224 --> 00:01:33.037
"He spilled nachos on you," Ringo said.

21
00:01:33.038 --> 00:01:35.670
"You were mad."

22
00:01:35.671 --> 00:01:41.072
Lucy huffed. "I didn't hurt him."

23
00:01:41.073 --> 00:01:42.998
Bzzt! Bzzt!

24
00:01:42.999 --> 00:01:45.898
Another robot rolled by.

25
00:01:45.899 --> 00:01:49.299
Sparks and glitter shot out from him.

26
00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:53.327
The robot banged into a wall. Bonk!

27
00:01:53.328 --> 00:01:55.297
He fell over.

28
00:01:55.298 --> 00:01:58.994
Another robot fell over too.

29
00:01:58.995 --> 00:02:01.698
Ringo scratched his head.

30
00:02:01.699 --> 00:02:05.079
"What's wrong with the robots?" he said.

31
00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:09.223
Suddenly the ship leaned to the side.

32
00:02:09.224 --> 00:02:14.750
"Whoa!" Passengers lost their balance.

33
00:02:14.751 --> 00:02:18.018
Ringo tumbled—right over the railing!

34
00:02:18.019 --> 00:02:23.213
"Ahh!"

